ild.\n2. LLR-026 states that the launch owns the child from when `Popen` returns.\n3. TC-026's Expected names the windows its tests actually drive.\n\nThen resubmit all three together. The draft is in the verdict file, because WI-881's spec is an ordinary one and intake won't mint it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3004,"cache_read_input_tokens":443872,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3004},"output_tokens":711,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7a511e73-e906-4589-9f31-ae73f8534ed7","uuid":"eebd9583-6ff7-40ea-ac26-cd87c78eae98","timestamp":"2026-10-10T20:28:17.417Z","request_id":"req_011CfuBpPDGdbLRt31jmWLvb"}
